1
00:00:04,404 --> 00:00:07,040
Seoul restaurants are crazy expensive for a reason

2
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:09,042
Out of all the Japanese food I've had

3
00:00:09,042 --> 00:00:11,111
this place was the best

4
00:00:11,111 --> 00:00:13,513
Was it really that good?

5
00:00:13,513 --> 00:00:15,382
Wait a second

6
00:00:16,416 --> 00:00:19,119
Why are you even here?

7
00:00:19,119 --> 00:00:22,022
Come on, not this again

8
00:00:22,022 --> 00:00:23,790
Where do you expect me to go at this hour?

9
00:00:23,790 --> 00:00:24,758
Wow…

10
00:00:24,758 --> 00:00:26,393
You really are shameless

11
00:00:26,393 --> 00:00:28,361
Now you're planning to sleep here too?

12
00:00:28,361 --> 00:00:30,630
What are you talking about now?

13
00:00:30,630 --> 00:00:33,133
You already squeezed
all my guide money out of me earlier

14
00:00:33,133 --> 00:00:34,300
That was the guide fee

15
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:36,036
Not a room charge

16
00:00:36,036 --> 00:00:39,105
So this is what they mean
when they say Seoul folks rob you blind

17
00:00:39,105 --> 00:00:40,540
Whatever

18
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:43,176
50 bucks a night for staying here

19
00:00:43,176 --> 00:00:45,311
That's dirt cheap, by the way

20
00:00:46,112 --> 00:00:47,647
I'm gonna go wash up

21
00:00:47,647 --> 00:00:49,649
Hey! Hey!

22
00:01:04,931 --> 00:01:07,067
Where am I sleeping?

23
00:01:07,067 --> 00:01:08,635
Sleep wherever

24
00:01:08,635 --> 00:01:11,271
Do I have to tell you everything?

25
00:01:11,271 --> 00:01:13,306
Yes!

26
00:01:14,774 --> 00:01:16,476
What the hell, are you insane?

27
00:01:16,476 --> 00:01:17,477
Get off

28
00:01:17,477 --> 00:01:20,146
You said sleep wherever I want

29
00:01:20,146 --> 00:01:21,381
This little psycho…

30
00:01:24,184 --> 00:01:25,452
My back…

31
00:01:25,452 --> 00:01:26,820
My tailbone…

32
00:01:26,820 --> 00:01:27,987
God…

33
00:01:30,190 --> 00:01:32,926
Put that down and sleep there quietly

34
00:02:33,553 --> 00:02:35,054
You're up early?

35
00:02:35,054 --> 00:02:37,390
What time is it now?

36
00:02:37,624 --> 00:02:39,492
It's only 7:30

37
00:02:39,492 --> 00:02:40,860
