38
00:02:41,060 --> 00:02:42,362
To work

39
00:02:42,362 --> 00:02:43,997
Oh… work…

40
00:02:43,997 --> 00:02:45,999
What are you doing today?

41
00:02:45,999 --> 00:02:47,734
No idea

42
00:02:47,734 --> 00:02:49,135
I didn't really plan anything

43
00:02:49,135 --> 00:02:53,139
If you get bored,
go check out Itaewon or Hongdae

44
00:02:53,373 --> 00:02:54,807
Hongdae?

45
00:02:54,807 --> 00:02:55,775
Itaewon?

46
00:02:56,342 --> 00:02:58,344
Or go back to sleep if you want

47
00:02:58,344 --> 00:03:00,380
Yeah, I'll do that

48
00:03:04,651 --> 00:03:06,819
I'm heading out

49
00:03:06,819 --> 00:03:09,222
I won't be back till tonight

50
00:03:09,222 --> 00:03:12,392
Just order something

51
00:03:12,392 --> 00:03:14,160
And clean up all the trash

52
00:03:14,160 --> 00:03:16,162
Okay…

53
00:03:38,585 --> 00:03:44,290
[DDEBAM TOY]

54
00:03:56,636 --> 00:03:58,972
Come to think of it… did he even eat?

55
00:04:07,780 --> 00:04:09,649
What the…?

56
00:04:10,783 --> 00:04:12,819
What is he doing…?

57
00:04:19,225 --> 00:04:21,594
How do you use this thing…?

58
00:05:33,800 --> 00:05:36,202
Has this idiot lost his mind…

59
00:06:01,294 --> 00:06:02,929
You're back?

60
00:06:02,929 --> 00:06:04,430
Earlier than I expected

61
00:06:04,430 --> 00:06:05,798
Well…

62
00:06:05,798 --> 00:06:07,400
Hard to stay out too long

63
00:06:07,400 --> 00:06:10,069
When I left a little mutt at home

64
00:06:10,069 --> 00:06:11,771
A mutt?

65
00:06:11,771 --> 00:06:13,606
Me?

66
00:06:13,606 --> 00:06:14,774
So

67
00:06:14,774 --> 00:06:16,876
What did you do all day by yourself?

68
00:06:16,876 --> 00:06:18,544
Well…

69
00:06:18,544 --> 00:06:20,713
walked around the neighborhood a bit

70
00:06:21,714 --> 00:06:22,582
grabbed some food too

71
00:06:22,582 --> 00:06:24,584
Mm-hm

72
00:06:24,717 --> 00:06:25,585
That's it

73
00:06:25,585 --> 00:06:26,586
Really?

74
00:06:26,586 --> 00:06:27,854
Yeah

75
00:06:28,488 --> 00:06:30,623
I don't think so

76
00:06:31,324 --> 00:06:32,925
