78
00:06:35,328 --> 00:06:37,296
with that sex toy

79
00:06:37,296 --> 00:06:39,966
What are you talking about

80
00:06:39,966 --> 00:06:42,001
What sex toy?

81
00:06:52,278 --> 00:06:54,881
Still gonna lie to me?

82
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:03,800
"Seoul Trip"
